SUMMARY:Panigiri of Profitis Ilias\, Drymona
LOCATION:Drymona\, Evia (North)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The mountain village of Drymona\, above the waterfall of the same name\, holds its Profitis Ilias panigiri in the schoolyard on 20 July with a live orchestra\, grilled meat and dancing\; it is in the municipal programme. Combine with a swim at the Drymona falls in the afternoon and drive carefully down the bends afterwards.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-north/#drymona-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-drymona
